The RINEX files here are IGS data distributed by the BKG IGS data center (https://igs.bkg.bund.de/root_ftp/IGS/): station WTZR, Geodetic Observatory Wettzell (BKG), and the IGS and DLR broadcast navigation files for 2025-019. IGS data are open; acknowledge the IGS and the station operator. Sources and hashes: PROVENANCE.md.
